  "pageText": {
    "home.heroSub": "Ballet, tap, jazz, hip-hop and more for ages 3–18 — taught with the warmth of a small studio and the standards of a serious one, for 40 years and counting.",
    "home.about": "Today it’s still led by founder and owner Barbara Hatch — “Miss Barb” to generations of dancers — alongside director and company choreographer Barbara Bouchard, who Miss Barb has announced will carry the studio forward as its next owner, and a faculty families know by name. Our dance family spans tiny dancers taking their first steps to company dancers preparing their Nutcracker solos — and we’d love to welcome yours.",
    "classes.intro": "From a first preschool combo class to pointe work and championship hip-hop — every class builds on a strong ballet foundation, taught by the faculty families know by name.",
    "classes.desc0": "Two or three styles in one class, sized for little attention spans. Combo pairs ballet with tap or jazz; Trio adds a third style as dancers grow — the gentlest possible start.",
    "classes.desc1": "Barre, center, and classical technique — the discipline underneath every other style we teach, and the reason our dancers move the way they do.",
    "classes.desc2": "The milestone every ballet dancer works toward. By teacher invitation once ankles and technique are ready — strength first, satin second.",
    "classes.desc3": "Rhythm, musicality, and fast feet — from first shuffles to intricate combinations. The class you hear from the lobby.",
    "classes.desc4": "Energy, precision, and performance style — leaps, turns, and the showmanship that carries straight onto the competition stage.",
    "classes.desc5": "Where ballet technique meets storytelling — expressive, flowing movement set to the music your dancer already loves.",
    "classes.desc6": "Modern movement, floor work, and improvisation layered over classical training. Taught within our Saturday Trio and throughout company choreography.",
    "classes.desc7": "Grooves, isolations, and full-out choreography — the style with a class for nearly every age, including one just for the boys.",
    "classes.desc8": "Tumbling, flexibility, and controlled strength — cartwheels to walkovers and beyond, taught safely and step by step.",
    "summer.sub": "Keep dancing all summer long — from princess camps for the littlest dancers to technique intensives for company kids. Tap any flyer for the full details, then register through the portal.",
    "nutcracker.lede": "Every other holiday season, Barbara’s Academy of Dance brings Clara, the Land of Sweets, and a stage full of snow to Farmington Hills — with a cast that spans the entire studio family, from our tiniest angels to the Performing Company.",
    "register.intro": "All students register each season — it takes a few minutes in the Parent Portal, and the office confirms your dancer’s spot.",
    "contact.phone": "(248) 476-7074",
    "contact.email": "barbarasdance2@gmail.com"
  }
}